  "instructions": [
    "Separate garlic cloves from head and drop in boiling water for 1 minute to loosen skins",
    "Remove skins and slice in half lengthwise",
    "Heat oil in a large skillet over medium high heat",
    "Add garlic , artichoke hearts , onion and lemon juice",
    "Saut until onions are tender",
    "Season with salt pepper & thyme",
    "Add butter , cover& simmer for 5 minutes , stirring occasionally",
    "Add vinegar and cook for an additional 3 minutes",
    "Sprinkle with fresh parsley"
